   <title>Short description rules</title>
   <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>Short</keyword>
        <keyword>description</keyword>
        <keyword>rules</keyword>
        <keyword>Every</keyword>
        <keyword>shortdesc</keyword>
        <keyword>Summarize</keyword>
        <indexterm>Short</indexterm>
        <indexterm>description</indexterm>
        <indexterm>rules</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>Every <codeph>&lt;shortdesc&gt;</codeph> must:<ul id="ul_11014336">
        <li>Summarize the topic in one sentence</li>
        <li>Be 50 words or fewer</li>
        <li>End with a period</li>
        <li>For task topics, begin with an infinitive verb phrase</li>
      </ul></p>
   </conbody>
